# SHA-256 manifest for files installed by install.sh (SEC-05 / AC-26).
#
# Verify with:  sha256sum -c checksums.sha256
#
# install.sh is deliberately NOT listed. It is the file being executed, so
# hashing it here would make every edit to the installer invalidate its own
# manifest. Shipped native binaries (for example a prebuilt llama-cli) MUST be
# listed here, and their hashes updated whenever the release binary changes.
#
f2eba9853b3775447a8172de206ec75dfba8f42b7974a5075c6a5f4f36641dec  nusa-rg.1
